  review and final handoff are complete for44/45; owner and recorder qualification remain separate.
  The owner's remote cursor-disappearance report is not yet independently reproduced/qualified.
- New15:05 request is DEEP RESEARCH/design for explicit dictated-question -> streamed Azure answer.
