## Definition of done

Every required checkbox and acceptance criterion is met. Evidence names actual source/artifact,
environment, commands/results or observations, and limits. Related docs/index/ledger agree.
Human usability approval is recorded where required. A passing build is not a capture test;
a capture test is not an invisibility guarantee; authored research is not a finished app.
Affected handbook chapters/citations/diagrams must match source; visible UI changes refresh synthetic
images. Significant milestones update root JOURNAL.md. The full HTML/PDF edition must be current
under Build-Handbook.ps1 -Check; generated outputs do not authorize publication.

